@startuml
title Publish an assigned course summary
start
:<b>Coach</b>\nLoad assigned draft and server-calculated attendance;
:<b>Coach</b>\nEnter results, progress and required comments;
:<b>Coach</b>\nConfirm missing attendance if necessary;
:<b>System</b>\nValidate authorship, draft state and required data;
if (Publication requirements satisfied?) then (Yes)
  :<b>System</b>\nPublish snapshot and increment revision atomically;
  :<b>System</b>\nQueue member notifications;
  :<b>Member</b>\nRead own published results or download result PDF;
else (No)
  :<b>System</b>\nKeep DRAFT and return required corrections;
endif
stop
@enduml
